From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kelvin Security Engineering <security@kelvin.local>
Date: Fri, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] security(nuclei): remediate CVE-2026-71556 go-git RCE vulnerability

Upgrade github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 to v5.14.0 to remediate arbitrary command
execution vulnerability (CVE-2026-71556).
---
 go.mod | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
index 78d91c2..92a11b8 100644
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -100,3 +100,5 @@ require (
 	golang.org/x/net v0.34.0
 )
+
+replace github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 => github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 v5.14.0
-- 
